                            	  3641: SecretArmosXs:
02:00039876 E0              	  3642:     dc.b    $E0, $B0, $B0, $30, $40, $90, $A0
02:00039877 B0
02:00039878 B0
02:00039879 30
02:0003987A 40
02:0003987B 90
02:0003987C A0
                            	  3643: 
