                            	  7829: IsrReset:
                            	  7830:     ; SEI: NES IRQ disable — NOP on Genesis (VBlank=NMI fires regardless of IRQ mask)
                            	  7831:     ; CLD: decimal mode ignored (68000 has no decimal mode)
